From: Stained Glass OS <ke7oxh@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] msvcrt: Implement __report_gsfailure and the remaining C++ runtime helper exports.

C++ and /GS runtime helpers that were spec stubs: __report_gsfailure (a
stack cookie check failed: the process ends as
__fastfail(FAST_FAIL_STACK_COOKIE_CHECK_FAILURE) ends it, with
STATUS_STACK_BUFFER_OVERRUN; msvcr80 and later, ucrtbase, vcruntime140),
the int overloads of set_terminate and set_unexpected that set_terminate(0)
compiles to (msvcr80 .. msvcr120), and ucrtbase's unexpected and
_is_exception_typeof, which Wine already implements for the C++ names
(vcruntime140 forwards).
